This code is vendored from: https://github.com/huggingface/controlnet_aux/tree/master/src/controlnet_aux/pidi

And includes the bugfix: https://github.com/huggingface/controlnet_aux/pull/109

This also includes a compatibility fix for ZoeDepth
so it can work with the latest version of timm

The vendored EfficientNet checkout at
normalbae/nets/submodules/efficientnet_repo
(https://github.com/rwightman/gen-efficientnet-pytorch)
had requirements.txt and setup.py removed. Those files
declared their own torch and torchvision requirements.
NormalBae loads that checkout locally through torch.hub,
so it is not installed as its own package.